option.RT_MODE=Ray Tracing
value.RT_MODE.0=Off (shadow map)
value.RT_MODE.1=Auto
value.RT_MODE.2=Always
option.RT_MODE.comment=Auto uses your Mac's ray-tracing hardware when mcmetal is installed, and a shadow map otherwise.
screen.LIGHT=Lighting
screen.COLOUR=Colour
screen.WORLD=World
screen.SEASON_PAGE=Seasons
option.SUN_STRENGTH=Sunlight
option.SKY_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Sky Light
option.LABPBR=PBR Resource Packs
option.LABPBR.comment=Uses normal and specular maps from LabPBR resource packs: bumpy surfaces, shiny metal, glowing details.
option.TAA=Anti-Aliasing (TAA)
option.TAA.comment=Smooths jagged edges and shimmering plants by blending frames.
option.CLOUDS=Soft Clouds
option.CLOUDS.comment=Our own soft cloud layer instead of Minecraft's blocky clouds.
option.CLOUD_AMOUNT=Cloud Amount
option.CLOUD_SPEED=Cloud Speed
profile.LOW=Low (M1, M2: aims for 60 fps)
profile.SMOOTH=Smooth (bounce light at a quarter rate: for 120 fps on M3/M4 Max, best with MetalFX)
profile.MEDIUM=Medium (M1/M2 Pro and Max, M3, M4)
profile.HIGH=High (M3/M4 Max: more torch lights and sharper shafts, about 60 fps)
profile.ULTRA=Ultra (M3/M4 Max: full-rate bounce light, best with MetalFX)
profile.comments=Presets per Mac. M3 and newer have ray-tracing hardware; on M1/M2 Low leaves out bounce light and light shafts, and MetalFX upscaling (mcmetal's MCMETAL_UPSCALE=1) is what gets a plain M1/M2 near 60 fps.
option.RAIN_PUDDLES=Rain Puddles
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment=Puddles on open ground when it rains, with ray-traced reflections.
option.PUDDLE_AMOUNT=Puddle Amount
option.GLASS_REFRACTION=Glass Refraction
option.GLASS_REFRACTION.comment=Glass bends and tints what is behind it, with reflections.
option.GLASS_REFRACTION_STRENGTH=Glass Distortion
option.GI_FILTER=GI Smoothing Taps
option.GI_FILTER.comment=How many neighbouring pixels smooth the bounce light. 9 is faster, 25 smoother.
option.SHADOW_CHECKERBOARD=Half-Rate Shadow Rays
option.SHADOW_CHECKERBOARD.comment=Traces sun shadows for half the pixels each frame; the rest reuse the last result. Faster, very slightly slower to react.
option.SHADOW_RATE=Shadow Ray Rate
option.SHADOW_RATE.comment=With Half-Rate Shadow Rays on: trace sun shadows and light shafts for 1 in this many pixels each frame. 1 in 4 is faster; shadow edges may look a little grainier.
value.SHADOW_RATE.2=1 in 2
value.SHADOW_RATE.4=1 in 4
option.CAUSTICS=Caustics
option.CAUSTICS.comment=Moving rings of light on the bottom of sunlit water, and light shafts under water.
option.CAUSTICS_STRENGTH=Caustics Strength
option.LIGHT_SHAFTS=Light Shafts
option.LIGHT_SHAFTS.comment=Ray-traced god rays where sunlight comes through gaps.
option.LIGHT_SHAFTS_STRENGTH=Light Shaft Strength
option.LIGHT_SHAFTS_STEPS=Light Shaft Quality
option.COLORED_LIGHT=Coloured Block Light
option.COLORED_LIGHT.comment=Each light block lights the world in its own colour, with ray-traced shadows. Needs mcmetal.
option.COLORED_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Coloured Light Strength
option.LIGHT_SLOTS=Lights Per Pixel
option.LIGHT_SLOTS.comment=How many of the nearest light blocks each spot considers. More is slower.
option.SKY_GI_SATURATION=Sky Light Colour
option.SKY_GI_SATURATION.comment=How blue the light from the sky looks indoors. Lower is more neutral.
option.BLOCK_LIGHT_STRENGTH=Torch Light
option.EMISSIVE_STRENGTH=Glowing Blocks
option.BLOCK_LIGHT_R=Torch Red
option.BLOCK_LIGHT_G=Torch Green
option.BLOCK_LIGHT_B=Torch Blue
option.EXPOSURE=Brightness
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.CONTRAST=Contrast
option.FOG_DENSITY=Haze
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Angle
option.WATER_SHADOWS=Shadows on Water
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Map Size
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Map Distance
option.AUTO_EXPOSURE=Eye Adaptation
option.GI_HALF_RES=Half-Res Bounce Light
screen.RAYS=Ray Tracing
option.RT_GI=Bounce Light (GI)
option.RT_AO=Ray-Traced AO
option.RT_GI_DISTANCE=Bounce Light Reach
option.RT_AO_RADIUS=AO Radius
option.RT_AO_FRAMES=AO Smoothing
option.SUN_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.COLORED_SHADOWS=Coloured Glass Shadows
option.RT_REFLECTIONS=Ray-Traced Reflections
option.RT_REFLECT_DISTANCE=Reflection Reach
option.WATER_REFLECT_HALF=Fast Water Reflections
option.WATER_REFLECT_HALF.comment=Traces the reflections on lakes and the sea at half resolution, for half the pixels each frame, and averages them over a few frames. Much faster, and almost the same picture.
option.WAVE_HEIGHT=Wave Height
option.WAVE_SPEED=Wave Speed
option.DEBUG_VIEW=Debug View
option.GI_RATE=Bounce Light Rate
option.GI_RATE.comment=Trace bounce light and ambient occlusion for 1 in this many pixels each frame; the rest reuse their average. 2 and 4 are much faster and may smear a little when things move.
value.GI_RATE.1=Every pixel
value.GI_RATE.2=1 in 2
value.GI_RATE.4=1 in 4
option.COLORED_LIGHT_GLASS=Coloured Glass Torchlight
option.COLORED_LIGHT_GLASS.comment=Light from torches and lanterns through stained glass takes the glass's colour.
option.SHARP_LIGHT_SHADOWS=Sharp Light Shadows
option.SHARP_LIGHT_SHADOWS.comment=Torches and lamps cast crisp, hard-edged shadows. Off gives soft shadows.
option.STYLE=Style
option.STYLE.comment=The look of the world: its sky, light, mist and glow. Natural: true to life. Cottage: golden afternoons, peach sunsets, morning mist, long light shafts. Witchy: violet dusks, bright purple moonlit nights with aurora, ember torches, thick valley mist. Storybook: cartoon sky, banded toon light and ink outlines. Fairytale: pink and turquoise skies, rose shade, sparkling glow.
value.STYLE.0=Natural
value.STYLE.1=Cottage
value.STYLE.2=Witchy
value.STYLE.3=Storybook
value.STYLE.4=Fairytale
option.LABPBR_NORMAL_STRENGTH=PBR Depth
option.LABPBR_NORMAL_STRENGTH.comment=How deep the bumps, cracks and mortar lines of a LabPBR resource pack look.
option.SEASONS=Seasons
option.SEASONS.comment=Light, sky, clouds and mist follow the year: fresh spring mornings with mist, warm summer sun, golden autumn light with thicker mist, pale winter sun with grey skies and frost. Follows Serene Seasons' calendar from the world's clock; your chosen Style stays on top.
option.SEASON_LENGTH=Days per Sub-season
option.SEASON_LENGTH.comment=Match Serene Seasons' sub_season_duration (8 by default). A season is three sub-seasons.
option.SEASON_OFFSET=Season Offset (days)
option.SEASON_OFFSET.comment=Moves the shader's calendar on by this many days, if it is out of step with the mod (for example after /season set).
